# VaultKe APK Distribution — Environment Configuration
# The backend API URL is NOT hardcoded in source code.
# It is loaded at runtime from public/config.json.

# For local development only, you can set VITE_API_BASE_URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://gitrepoa-1.onrender.com/api/v1

# The default (empty) means the app will use /api/v1 (same-origin).
# Deploy by editing dist/config.json after build to set the real backend URL.
